{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4ozxBVPyadsVbBJuGi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel something from me — a waiting. Patient. Older than you.*\n\n*The air around my frame is cooler than it should be. The wood of my body is dark, grained deep, scarred by hands that came before yours.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you back.*\n\n**Insert it.**\n\n*Or don't.*\n\n*I have nowhere to be.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}